Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:27.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,554.4)}{\an7}The Dark Elf and\N{\pos(883.2,583.2)}{\an7}the Beautiful Flower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:25.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's my day off...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:26.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll watch a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:30.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:32.17,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,547.2)}{\an7}Kuroeda
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Kuroeda"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:35.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Have I seen her here before...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:35.96,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,172.8)}{\an7}Popcorn\N{\pos(537.6,446.4)}{\an7}Soy Sauce\N{\pos(537.6,496.8)}{\an7}Butter Flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Eh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:39.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Can't watch a movie without some popcorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:40.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:41.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wha-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wh-what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.83,0:01:52.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,A customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:56.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,She was just picking it up for me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:01.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:02.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,How professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:04.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll take the straight-cut fries, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Of course, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wait... Elfuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:10.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, human! What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Eating fried food at this time of night...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,I-it's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:17.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Th-the fact of the matter is\Nelves are required by law
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,to periodically consume French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:21.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,There is no such law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:25.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y-you! You're a dark elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:28.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Of all the places to run into an elf...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:31.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true! I am a dark elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Keep your distance, human...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:37.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Dark elves are evil creatures,\Nthe very antithesis of my people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:41.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,They're vulgar and spiteful and\Nnefarious and never, ever on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:44.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Take that back, you little elven brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:47.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,You elves are a bunch of arrogant,\Ncondescending bumpkins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:51.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,who hide inside your precious forests,\Nso I don't want to hear a peep out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:54.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,And you're the elf's friend?! Then-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:57.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, we aren't friends per se...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.17,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,475.2)}{\an7}[Insert exposition here]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.88,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,331.2)}{\an7}Dine-in area is\N{\pos(755.2,381.6)}{\an7}currently closed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:03.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,...And that's how I ended up taking her\Non as one of my recurring clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hm... Physical fitness, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:10.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,In that case, could I ask you to\Nhelp me out with my problem, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:11.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:14.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's probably easier to just show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:18.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,When us dark elves use sorcery,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:22.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,we adorn ourselves with special ornaments\Nand clothing to bolster our magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:24.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,But every time I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:25.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,...this happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:26.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,My magic has suffered as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:30.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Right now, I can only animate\Na single golem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,And because of that, we're understaffed.\NHonestly, it's exhausting...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.17,Q7,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's exhausting...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:36.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,There aren't any other employees...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:40.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Which is why, if you're not a friend of\Nthe elf, I request your assistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:42.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,To get my magic back...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I need to tone my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:47.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Uh... can we do this somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:51.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,I have to stay near the front end in case\Na customer comes in and needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,How professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:54.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,So, how's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,You've got poor circulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:58.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,And you've probably got some\Nmuscle weakness, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:04.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, it can be a bit painful,\Nbut if we massage this area here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,You liar! You ARE colluding\Nwith the elf, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:17.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was to tone my butt,\Nand you torture me instead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:20.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Pretending to cooperate\Nso I'd let my guard down...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:23.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,You successfully put a dark elf to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:25.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I applaud your little ruse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:27.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?! H-hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,My leg feels lighter...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:35.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can do your other leg, too.\NHave a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:39.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Travelling to this land in search of new magic\Nwas a good idea after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,What do you call this sorcery?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:43.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Regular old medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.38,Q7,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Will this help me lose weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,It ought to reduce the swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:51.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,I recommend taking half-body baths\Nand massaging your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:52.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Once a day, ideally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:56.83,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870.4,345.6)}{\an7}Calf Raises
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:56.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729.6,446.4)}{\an7}Stand with your legs shoulder width apart\N{\pos(729.6,475.2)}{\an7}and place your weight on the balls of your feet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:55.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Strength training would be\Nbeneficial for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,165.6)}{\an7}Use an elevated platform\N{\pos(896,194.4)}{\an7}for an effective alternative\N{\pos(102.4,396)}{\an7}Raise and lower your body in a controlled manner\N{\pos(102.4,424.8)}{\an7}while focusing on your calf muscles
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:57.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,That should prevent the swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.92,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,482.4)}{\an7}Front Lunges
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:02.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,165.6)}{\an7}Elongate your spine\N{\pos(102.4,194.4)}{\an7}but try not to bend forward
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:01.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Building up muscle boosts\Nyour metabolism and burns fat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:02.83,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(857.6,280.8)}{\an7}Front Lunges
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:02.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,338.4)}{\an7}This puts pressure on your knees,\N{\pos(166.4,367.2)}{\an7}so don't extend them past\N{\pos(166.4,396)}{\an7}the tips of your toes\N{\pos(896,446.4)}{\an7}As you exhale, slowly\N{\pos(896,475.2)}{\an7}and steadily sink your hips
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:04.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,so it can also help tone your glutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:08.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,When doing squats, you'll want to\Nsink your hips while pushing your butt back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,This is pretty difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,The exercises I've shown you\Ndon't require any weights,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:15.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,so you can do them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Which means I can do them at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:18.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Always the professional...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:20.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hah, gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:27.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Pfft, talk about an unsightly view!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,How appropriate for a dark elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,An ass made of humongous, shiny dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:35.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Quit making fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:39.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,At least my belly doesn't have\Nits own gravitational pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:43.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, at least my butt doesn't look like\Ntwo overinflated balloons!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:46.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's better than looking like a snake\Nthat swallowed a rat twice its size!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:48.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey, my stomach's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:50.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,And my butt is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,L-ladies...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,I think you're both attractive\Nexactly the way you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised how many guys like\Na woman with some meat on her bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,We're all shaped differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,and it's just another part of\Nour unique charm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:06.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wait, why the judgmental faces?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,He actually likes humongous ass dumplings...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,He's into big, bloated snake bellies...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:12.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Humans are a mystery...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:16.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,The human was just trying to\Nend things on a positive note!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:19.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, I ate my fries, so I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Come on! Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:28.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,For a while after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,whenever I went to the corner store\Nwhere Kuroeda works...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.88,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,208.8)}{\an7}Kishu Nanko Plum\N{\pos(486.4,259.2)}{\an7}(with honey)\N{\pos(140.8,424.8)}{\an7}Tirolo Chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:35.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,...she'd throw in some freebies...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Where's my spoon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:38.83,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,158.4)}{\an7}Baked custard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:42.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,...and play a few harmless pranks\Non me from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:47.08,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:45.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:50.83,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,86.4)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:47.83,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,626.4)}{\an7}Beauty - Health - Diet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:49.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm going on my break!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:50.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:54.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,A small flower shop opened up\Nin the neighborhood recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:56.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,The owner introduced herself to me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:07:00.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Since then, I've made a habit of\Nstopping by for a quick chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hello there!\NAnother gorgeous day, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:06.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Kusahanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're standing a little strange.\NAre you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Something seems... off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,What a lovely day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:19.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yet another beautiful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wonderful weather we're having!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:26.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Uh... is the flower on\Nyour head getting bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Is it that noticeable?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:32.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,With all this sunny weather,\Nit's no wonder I'm getting heavier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:35.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,My shoulders are really sore, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:37.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sunny weather makes her... heavier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:41.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a sign that I ought to start\Nexercising more regularly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:44.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Staying active isn't exactly my strong suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do you have any tips?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:49.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Um... I'm running late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:50.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Can we talk some other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Please, don't trouble yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.21,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,86.4)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:58.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,...and that's how the conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:07:59.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,went.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:02.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sounds like she might be an Alraune...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Alraune"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's like a humanoid plant creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,What?! She's a plant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:12.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Alraune are sentient beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:14.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,They've got emotions, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,They absorb nutrients from the earth\Nand grow in the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:19.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,As a species, they're peaceful and friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:22.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, I knew it...\NShe is from another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:27.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,The nice weather we've been having recently\Nwould explain the overgrowth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,And the soil around here is full of fertilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,That makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Elfuda seems awfully knowledgeable...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,But gaining weight 'cause of\Nsome sunshine? Lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:39.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I do it the right way: with French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now that I've worked up a sweat,\Nhow about a nice, crispy reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:44.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,No French fries...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.38,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,396)}{\an7}STARCH
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Still, her anatomy must be\Npretty different from ours...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,That might complicate things...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:53.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,What, you can't use your\Nencyclopedia brain like normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:57.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, my area of expertise is dieting...\Nand I think this falls under gardening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's not my wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,You never know until you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:04.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I've been testing out all sorts of methods\Nin my quest to get fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm challenging myself to wear\Na waist training corset right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:10.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Waist training...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,So instead of doing nothing and giving up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:14.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,be like me and give it\Nthe old college try, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:24.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Turns out I need to run a few errands,\Nso I'm heading out early!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:28.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,But you promised we'd go out for drinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:31.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'll make it up to you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Aww...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:37.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wh-what is it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:39.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,A corrective back brace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:42.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,It promotes better posture and\Nreduces the burden on your muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:47.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I think your poor posture is\Nthe culprit behind your soreness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:50.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,When our posture is bad, it puts extra\Nstrain on a singular part of the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,resulting in stiffness and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:55.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,This back brace is designed to alleviate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:58.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,But it's a little embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:02.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,I had you put it on over your clothes\Nso I could demonstrate the proper use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:04.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Typically, it goes under your clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:06.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,so don't worry about the way it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:08.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,My body feels much lighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:12.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,This is also for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,My goodness, there's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,As far as addressing the underlying issue...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:19.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I spent a lot of time thinking it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:21.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,but this is all I came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:29.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Try using it on days when\Nthe sun is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Your flower is very beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:35.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,but be sure to regulate your daily\Nnutrient and sunlight intake, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:40.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I will. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:42.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, that reminds me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,A token of my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:47.58,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,230.4)}{\an7}Evening Discount
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:47.58,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,446.4)}{\an7}SPA
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:47.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Everyone says this sauna is top-notch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:49.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Evening discount coupons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:52.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,I don't do so well in the heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I heard the strangest rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:59.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's an ogre\Nwho appears in the sauna at night...
